However, per hints: "To compose two widgets, define a fresh 'umbrella' layer with fluid.topLevelWidget as the last of its $layers, holding each of them as a subcomponent... Choose the view of just one of them... If both widgets must remain visible, the umbrella may instead have a template of its own holding an @id element for each subcomponent."

